PP-OCRv6 OCR models
===================

tiny/ holds the PP-OCRv6 "tiny" detection model, recognition model and
character dictionary:

    PP-OCRv6_det_tiny.onnx
    PP-OCRv6_rec_tiny.onnx
    ppocrv6_tiny_dict.txt

Upstream project: https://github.com/PaddlePaddle/PaddleOCR
