The ONNX files are the conversions the Snow Shot OCR mirror on ModelScope
(mgchao/SnowShotOCR) republishes from PaddleOCR's Apache-2.0 models, and the
same mirror serves the Small and Medium tiers that Unisic downloads at
runtime. The bytes here are unmodified: the SHA-256 pins in
src/ocr/PaddleOcr.cpp are these files' hashes, and CMakeLists.txt checks them
at configure time, so a changed or truncated file stops the build instead of
shipping.

Unisic embeds these three files through the qrc CMakeLists.txt builds (the
resource paths are :/paddleocr/tiny/...). The other
tiers are not bundled; they are downloaded on request into
<AppDataLocation>/paddleocr/<tier>/.
